      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int(\\ln x)^2\\,dx",
        "du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx,\\qquad v=x",
        "\\int(\\ln x)^2dx=x(\\ln x)^2-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx",
        "\\begin{aligned}\\int(\\ln x)^2dx&=x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x\\\\&\\quad+2x+C\\end{aligned}",
        "\\int(\\ln x)^n dx=x(\\ln x)^n-n\\int(\\ln x)^{n-1}dx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "① 試一題",
      "body": [
        "係數規律：$1,\\ -3,\\ 3\\cdot2,\\ -3\\cdot2\\cdot1$",
